Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.14 01/24] arm64: dts: Fix gpio to pinmux mapping
Date:   Wed, 30 Oct 2019 11:55:32 -0400
Message-Id: <20191030155555.10494-1-sashal@kernel.org>
